OL,3,GNEWSAMajor crackdown on flag lamp-post
OL,4,Aactivists
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who put flags on public
OL,7,Flamp-posts and railings could face
OL,8,Fprison or fines under new rules being
OL,9,Fconsidered by councils.
OL,11,FIt comes as authorities across the West
OL,12,Fof England say they have had to pay
OL,13,Fthousands of pounds to have the flags
OL,14,Fremoved.
OL,16,FBristol Lib Dem councillor Stephen
OL,17,FWilliams said councils are in a
OL,18,F"cat-and-mouse situation", with workers
OL,19,Ftaking the flags down and then people
OL,20,Fputting them back up again.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
