OL,3,GNEWSAMajor crackdown on flag lamp-post
OL,4,Aactivists
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeginning in the summer of 2025,
OL,7,Fthousands of St George flags have
OL,8,Fappeared in towns and cities across
OL,9,FEngland, with individuals and groups
OL,10,Fbehind them saying they wanted to
OL,11,Fcelebrate patriotism.
